│   └── 20k/
│       ├── training_features.csv      # Training set (up to Q4 2025)
│       └── selected_features.json     # Feature list from MI selection
├── test_sets/
│   └── test_20k_Q1_2026.csv           # Test set with ground truth
└── refactored_test_dir/               # Debug/validation outputs (existing)
```

---

### 4. Evaluation Workflow (after model training)

Once we have the trained model + test set:

```
Train on: models/20k/training_features.csv
Predict on: test_sets/test_20k_Q1_2026.csv (features only)
Compare against: test_sets/test_20k_Q1_2026.csv (TargetFlag column)
```

Metrics to compute: Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1, AUC-ROC, Confusion Matrix.

