## Open Questions

> [!WARNING]
> **Feature data files (RFM, Appointments, VHC, Digital Sessions):** These are also cumulative. Should `process_service_data` filter them by date too, or are they point-in-time snapshots that don't change? If they contain records from Q1 2026, using them in training would leak future info.

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> **`selected_features.json`:** The feature list from MI selection on the training set must be saved and reused for the test set. The test set should NOT run its own `feature_sel()` — it must use the exact same columns as training.

---

## Execution Order

1. Modify `__main__` block → parameterize `filter_date` and quarter
2. Run training pipeline for Q1/2026 (cutoff: Dec 31, 2025) → save training set + feature list
3. Create `prepare_test_set.py` → build Q1 2026 test cohort
4. Run test set through `process_service_data(filter_date="2025-12-31")` → save test set
5. Verify both CSVs have identical column schemas
6. Ready for model training + evaluation
